  { apply (VDKC.INIT RSEGS AD L HI KL SF sst str_at str_own str_size str_pot str_txt STR_KEEP M model LBX cr so os sp x 14736 144 (cells R r) bufs Hso1 Hso2 Hos1 Hos2 BRX (HF) (HSCR) ltac:(intros b []) M1 HH1 MOK STK MG1 FRZ' SA CSO BASE); [| intros b []].
