    apply (ZK R M model K LBX cr so os sp r dp x K0 Hso1 Hso2 Hos1 Hos2 APT CR SZ BRX Rsp Rgp Rtp RAok Hdp2 KONT fx5 R5 M2 model x cr IV2 RC5).
  - (* [comment removed for export] *)
    assert (DNZ : d mod 2 ^ 63 <> 0) by (apply VDF.feq0_nz; [exact Hd| exact E0]).
